{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In order to be eligible, a number of conditions must be fulfilled:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The library is in an enabled state. If the user has previously declined an invite","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"or completed a survey, the library will be in a disabled state. Otherwise, the library is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in an enabled state."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The user has met the loyalty threshold defined in your exp_configuration.json file.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The user is in the sampling pool. If the previous two conditions have been met, the library"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"makes an HTTP call to our servers to determine if the user is in the sampling pool. If s\/he is,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the invite will be presented. If not, the invite will not be shown. Disable this remote check with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"setSkipPoolingCheck:"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"}]}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/exppredictive\/exppredictive\/checkifeligibleforsurvey"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Checks to see if the user is currently eligible to be invited 